# Witherbloom Command's "Target opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life" with its opponent no longer a legal target
# (CR 608.2b): Bot1 destroys its own Mox Ruby and drains Bot2, and Bot2 gains protection from everything with Teferi's
# Protection in response. The destroy mode keeps the spell resolving; Bot2 loses nothing, but the gain does not use the
# target, so Bot1 still gains 2 life (the rulings on the Commands: the rest of the mode's instructions still happen).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Witherbloom Command
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Teferi's Protection
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Witherbloom Command.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2; 4)
Bot1.Target(Mox Ruby)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Teferi's Protection.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby = (absent)
Exile = Teferi's Protection
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 20
